@TaskApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5194
@email = alice@example.com
# Replace with a password of your choice before sending register/login.
@password = CHANGE_ME

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/health

### Register a user (password needs upper, lower, digit and symbol, 6+ chars)
POST {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Log in. Copy accessToken from the response into @token below.
POST {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### List tasks (paged). All query parameters are optional.
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter, search and sort (sort: id, title, createdAt, updatedAt; prefix "-" for descending)
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?isCompleted=false&search=api&sort=-createdAt
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Try .http file",
  "description": "Created from VS Code/Visual Studio HTTP client"
}

### Validation error: returns a 400 ProblemDetails with field errors
POST {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": ""
}

###
PUT {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "description": "Updated via PUT",
  "isCompleted": true
}

###
DELETE {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token: 401
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
